[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#FF0000]🎃 Halloween Plugin v3.0.0 - MAJOR UPDATE[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFD700]⚠️ BREAKING CHANGES - READ BEFORE UPDATING[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B][COLOR=#FF6600]Plugin Folder Name Changed:[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Old: [FONT=Courier New]plugins/Halloween/[/FONT]
[*]New: [FONT=Courier New]plugins/Halloween_Softici/[/FONT]
[*][B]Prevents conflicts[/B] with other Halloween plugins
[*][B]Auto-detection[/B] warns if old folder exists
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#FF6600]Config Structure Changed:[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]intervals:[/FONT] → [FONT=Courier New]events:[/FONT]
[*][FONT=Courier New]pumpkin_monster:[/FONT] → [FONT=Courier New]pumpkin_zombie_boss:[/FONT]
[*][FONT=Courier New]pumpkin_witch:[/FONT] → [FONT=Courier New]pumpkin_skeleton_boss:[/FONT]
[*]All events now have [FONT=Courier New]enabled: true/false[/FONT] flag
[*][B]Auto-migration[/B] preserves your settings
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFD700]✨ New Features[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B]🦇 Bat Transformation Event (NEW!)[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Bats have 33% chance to transform into witches when killed
[*]Transformed witches spawn with pumpkin helmet + glow effect
[*]1.5x health multiplier
[*]Random useful potion drops: [I]Strength, Swiftness, Regeneration, Healing, Fire Resistance[/I]
[*]3-8 pumpkin drops + 5 XP levels
[*]Fully configurable in [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT]
[/LIST]

[CODE]
bat_transformation:
  enabled: true
  chance: 0.33           # 33% transformation rate
  health_multiplier: 1.5
  xp_reward: 5
  rewards:
    pumpkins_min: 3
    pumpkins_max: 8
    potion_drop: true    # Random useful potion
[/CODE]

[B]🎯 Per-Event Toggle System[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Each event now has individual [FONT=Courier New]enabled: true/false[/FONT] flag
[*]Disable specific events without removing config sections
[*]Works immediately after [FONT=Courier New]/halloween reload[/FONT]
[*]Example: Turn off pumpkin heads but keep Slenderman
[/LIST]

[CODE]
events:
  pumpkin:
    enabled: true   # ✅ NOW WORKS!
    min: 5
    max: 15
  
  slenderman:
    enabled: false  # ✅ Completely disabled
    min: 10
    max: 20
[/CODE]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFD700]🐛 Critical Bug Fixes[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Fixed: Event [FONT=Courier New]enabled: false[/FONT] not working[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Previously, setting [FONT=Courier New]enabled: false[/FONT] had no effect
  [*]All 6 event tasks updated (pumpkin, slenderman, fire, lightning, darkness, herobrine)
  [*]Now properly checks enabled flag before scheduling
  [/LIST]

[*][B]Fixed: Bat witch potion drops were broken[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Old: Dropped uncraftable potions with no effects
  [*]New: Random useful potions (Strength/Swiftness/Regeneration/Healing/Fire Resistance)
  [*]Uses Minecraft 1.21.1 compatible potion types
  [/LIST]

[*][B]Fixed: XP errors in 3 locations[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*][FONT=Courier New]IllegalArgumentException: Experience must be positive[/FONT]
  [*]Fixed in GraveManager, PumpkinMonsterManager, PumpkinWitchManager
  [*]Now validates XP before setting
  [/LIST]

[*][B]Fixed: Config version overwrite during migration[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Config migration no longer overwrites [FONT=Courier New]config_version[/FONT]
  [*]Preserves version marker for future updates
  [/LIST]

[*][B]Fixed: Deprecated sections added to fresh installs[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Removed [FONT=Courier New]pumpkin_protector:[/FONT] (was not working)
  [*]Removed standalone [FONT=Courier New]herobrine:[/FONT] (use [FONT=Courier New]events.herobrine:[/FONT])
  [*]Fresh v3.0.0 configs only contain working features
  [/LIST]

[*][B]Code Cleanup[/B]
  [LIST]
  [*]Removed 200+ lines of dead migration code
  [*]Cleaner codebase for future updates
  [/LIST]
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFD700]🔄 Migration Guide[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B]Updating from v1.x/v2.x:[/B]

[B]Step 1:[/B] Backup your config
[CODE]
# Windows PowerShell:
copy plugins\Halloween\config.yml plugins\Halloween\config.yml.backup
copy plugins\Halloween\data.yml plugins\Halloween\data.yml.backup
[/CODE]

[B]Step 2:[/B] Stop server, replace JAR file

[B]Step 3:[/B] Start server
[LIST]
[*]Plugin creates new [FONT=Courier New]Halloween_Softici/[/FONT] folder
[*]Auto-generates v3.0.0 config structure
[*]Shows warning if old [FONT=Courier New]Halloween/[/FONT] folder detected
[/LIST]

[B]Step 4:[/B] Migrate player data (optional)
[CODE]
copy plugins\Halloween\data.yml plugins\Halloween_Softici\data.yml
[/CODE]

[B]Step 5:[/B] Verify and cleanup
[CODE]
/halloween reload      # Check for errors
/halloween set pumpkin 1 1  # Test events
# After testing, delete old Halloween/ folder
[/CODE]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FFD700]📝 Updated Commands[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[CODE]
/halloween cleanup [all]  # NEW: Remove entities, "all" includes traders
/halloween set <event> 0 0  # Set to 0 0 to disable event
/halloween reload  # Restarts all tasks with new config
[/CODE]

